{"info": {"author": null, "author_email": "Kar Petrosyan <kar.petrosyanpy@gmail.com>", "bugtrack_url": null, "classifiers": ["Development Status :: 5 - Production/Stable", "Environment :: Web Environment", "Framework :: AsyncIO", "Framework :: Trio", "Intended Audience :: Developers", "License :: OSI Approved :: BSD License", "Operating System :: OS Independent", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3 :: Only", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.10", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.13", "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.14", "Topic :: Internet :: WWW/HTTP"], "description": "\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Hishel Logo\" width=\"350\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karpetrosyan/hishel/master/docs/static/Shelkopryad_350x250_yellow.png#gh-dark-mode-only\">\n</p>\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">Hishel</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <strong>Elegant HTTP Caching for Python</strong>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/hishel\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/pypi/v/hishel.svg\" alt=\"PyPI version\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/hishel\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/pypi/pyversions/hishel.svg\" alt=\"Python versions\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/karpetrosyan/hishel/blob/master/LICENSE\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/pypi/l/hishel\" alt=\"License\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://coveralls.io/github/karpetrosyan/hishel\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/coverallsCoverage/github/karpetrosyan/hishel\" alt=\"Coverage\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://static.pepy.tech/badge/hishel/month\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.pepy.tech/badge/hishel/month\" alt=\"Downloads\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n**Hishel** (\u0570\u056b\u0577\u0565\u056c, *to remember* in Armenian) is a modern HTTP caching library for Python. It adds caching to [HTTPX](https://www.python-httpx.org/), [Requests](https://requests.readthedocs.io/) and ASGI applications with minimal code changes, either by your own limits or by following the [RFC 9111](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9111.html) specification.\n\n## \u2728 Features\n\n- \ud83c\udfaf **RFC 9111 Mode** - Optionally follow the latest HTTP caching specification\n- \ud83d\udd0c **Easy Integration** - Drop-in support for HTTPX, HTTPX2, Requests, ASGI and FastAPI\n- \ud83d\udcbe **Flexible Storage** - SQLite and Redis backends, or write your own\n- \u26a1 **High Performance** - Efficient caching with minimal overhead\n- \ud83d\udd04 **Async & Sync** - Full support for both synchronous and asynchronous workflows\n- \ud83c\udfa8 **Type Safe** - Fully typed with comprehensive type hints\n- \ud83e\uddea **Well Tested** - Extensive test coverage and battle-tested\n- \ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f **Configurable** - TTL, TTI and size limits, with per-request overrides\n- \ud83d\udca8 **Memory Efficient** - Streaming support prevents loading large payloads into memory\n\nDocumentation is available at: [https://hishel.com](https://hishel.com)", "description_content_type": "text/markdown", "docs_url": null, "download_url": null, "downloads": {"last_day": -1, "last_month": -1, "last_week": -1}, "dynamic": null, "home_page": null, "keywords": null, "license": null, "license_expression": null, "license_files": ["LICENSE"], "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": null, "name": "hishel", "package_url": "https://pypi.org/project/hishel/", "platform": null, "project_url": "https://pypi.org/project/hishel/", "project_urls": {"Homepage": "https://hishel.com", "Source": "https://github.com/karpetrosyan/hishel"}, "provides_extra": ["async", "fastapi", "httpx", "httpx2", "redis", "requests"], "release_url": "https://pypi.org/project/hishel/2.0.0/", "requires_dist": ["msgpack>=1.2.2", "typing-extensions>=4.16.0", "anyio>=4.14.2; extra == \"async\"", "anysqlite>=0.0.5; extra == \"async\"", "anyio>=4.14.2; extra == \"fastapi\"", "anysqlite>=0.0.5; extra == \"fastapi\"", "fastapi>=0.141.1; extra == \"fastapi\"", "anyio>=4.14.2; extra == \"httpx\"", "anysqlite>=0.0.5; extra == \"httpx\"", "httpx>=0.28.1; extra == \"httpx\"", "anyio>=4.9.0; extra == \"httpx2\"", "anysqlite>=0.0.5; extra == \"httpx2\"", "httpx2>=2.9.1; extra == \"httpx2\"", "redis>=8.1.0; extra == \"redis\"", "requests>=2.34.2; extra == \"requests\""], "requires_python": ">=3.10", "summary": "Elegant HTTP Caching for Python", "version": "2.0.0", "yanked": false, "yanked_reason": null}, "release_dates": {"0.0.1": "2023-07-22T06:53:17.779059Z", "0.0.10": "2023-08-07T09:28:58.164049Z", "0.0.11": "2023-08-15T12:18:45.285723Z", "0.0.12": "2023-09-08T07:14:36.516073Z", "0.0.13": "2023-10-05T06:27:35.270679Z", "0.0.14": "2023-10-23T13:16:29.304228Z", "0.0.15": "2023-10-25T13:59:54.341859Z", "0.0.16": "2023-10-25T14:13:07.747956Z", "0.0.17": "2023-11-06T08:29:16.178015Z", "0.0.18": "2023-11-23T08:14:44.422076Z", "0.0.19": "2023-11-30T05:44:38.696657Z", "0.0.2": "2023-07-25T13:11:14.481956Z", "0.0.20": "2023-12-12T09:29:52.019314Z", "0.0.21": "2023-12-29T10:37:51.132675Z", "0.0.22": "2024-01-31T07:06:29.686701Z", "0.0.23": "2024-02-14T06:37:59.898383Z", "0.0.24": "2024-02-14T20:11:56.750254Z", "0.0.25": "2024-03-26T19:34:14.884143Z", "0.0.26": "2024-04-12T17:40:56.183635Z", "0.0.27": "2024-05-31T14:56:38.807777Z", "0.0.28": "2024-06-23T14:10:54.109327Z", "0.0.29": "2024-06-23T14:17:17.785500Z", "0.0.3": "2023-07-28T11:58:59.600034Z", "0.0.30": "2024-07-12T15:28:15.471434Z", "0.0.31": "2024-09-22T11:24:38.202789Z", "0.0.32": "2024-09-27T07:42:06.770233Z", "0.0.33": "2024-10-04T15:51:53.497089Z", "0.0.4": "2023-07-29T07:22:51.849306Z", "0.0.5": "2023-07-29T08:30:05.977319Z", "0.0.6": "2023-07-29T16:16:53.614233Z", "0.0.7": "2023-07-30T06:18:05.980178Z", "0.0.8": "2023-07-31T08:07:51.140028Z", "0.0.9": "2023-08-01T13:49:29.123368Z", "0.1.0": "2024-11-02T07:55:25.964340Z", "0.1.1": "2024-11-02T09:04:21.265120Z", "0.1.2": "2025-04-04T21:15